    <div class="fl-foot">
      <span class="fl-verdict">{{ t('Verdict', '结论') }}: <b>{{ flow.verdict }}</b></span>
      <details class="fl-more"><summary>{{ t('What this is &amp; how it was validated', '这是什么 · 如何验证') }}</summary>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px;margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.55;max-width:95ch">{{ t(
          'A detection + description layer, NOT a forecast. It ranks where cross-sectional flow is concentrating across the unbiased point-in-time GICS sectors and the thematic baskets, and maps the cross-group cluster. Rigorously validated to have NO forward edge (rank-IC ~0 on clean sectors; the basket "edge" was survivorship) — the read-quality bar measures data/coherence, not directional confidence. The cohesion gate is the one measured-but-modest, stress-conditional signal (a dispersion-recovery proxy, not inflows). Built on a ~3y cache; reconfirm as data accrues. A wide detector that focuses a separate inference layer — never scored, never an axis.',
          '这是探测+描述层，并非预测。它在无偏的时点 GICS 行业与主题篮子中排出资金横截面集中之处，并刻画跨组集群结构。经严格验证无前瞻优势（干净行业 rank-IC≈0；篮子的"优势"实为幸存者偏差）— 读数质量条衡量数据/一致性，而非方向置信度。共动门是唯一实测但有限、压力条件下的信号（压力离散修复代理，并非资金流入）。基于约3年缓存，随数据积累需复核。这是聚焦独立推断层的"宽探测器" — 从不评分、绝不入轴。') }}
          <a href="#" onclick="return false" class="muted" style="text-decoration:underline" title="See data/group_flow/validation_meta.json">{{ t('validation meta', '验证元数据') }}</a></p>
